  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44116172",
      "title": "The Problem With OnPush, Cross-Component Data & Not Using Signals",
      "lectureOrder": 203,
      "videoOrder": 195,
      "sourceHash": "d7e6441aa42faf59903b2efd0391c2a45c653147a9ba2edda41417ab4651296f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.176,
          "end": 1.89,
          "en": "So let's migrate to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.89,
          "end": 4.08,
          "en": "a non Signal based service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.08,
          "end": 7.59,
          "en": "And for that, I'll start by converting my messages property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.59,
          "end": 10.98,
          "en": "in the messages service to a normal property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.98,
          "end": 13.02,
          "en": "which is not a Signal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.02,
          "end": 15.984,
          "en": "which will hold an array of strings,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.984,
          "end": 16.95,
          "en": "which initially is empty",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 16.95,
          "end": 19.803,
          "en": "and therefore I can remove that Signal function import.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.36,
          "end": 25.89,
          "en": "All messages then should be a gather, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.89,
          "end": 30.333,
          "en": "where I simply return a copy of these messages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.22,
          "end": 34.14,
          "en": "And then add message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.14,
          "end": 36.96,
          "en": "I will overwrite these messages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.96,
          "end": 39.15,
          "en": "by also creating such a copy,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.15,
          "end": 40.85,
          "en": "and by then adding the new message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.158,
          "end": 43.853,
          "en": "as a last element into this new array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.979,
          "end": 47.76,
          "en": "In the new message component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.76,
          "end": 51.278,
          "en": "we now continue calling add message as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.278,
          "end": 55.38,
          "en": "and it does not matter whether entered text is a Signal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.38,
          "end": 58.798,
          "en": "or not, but we could also change that from a Signal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.798,
          "end": 62.283,
          "en": "to a regular property, a regular string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.15,
          "end": 66.99,
          "en": "and then down here, not read it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.99,
          "end": 71.463,
          "en": "and reset it by simply setting it to a regular string again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.32,
          "end": 75.57,
          "en": "In the template we don't need to change anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.57,
          "end": 78.723,
          "en": "because the template binding syntax is always the same.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.85,
          "end": 84.06,
          "en": "And in the messages list component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.06,
          "end": 87.84,
          "en": "I now don't wanna get my messages like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 87.84,
          "end": 90.663,
          "en": "Instead, I'll add a get here, messages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 91.89,
          "end": 96.89,
          "en": "where I'll return this messages service, all messages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 97.77000000000001,
          "end": 99.39,
          "en": "which will therefore give me that array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 99.39,
          "end": 100.983,
          "en": "of strings in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 103.5,
          "end": 106.86,
          "en": "In the template we therefore no longer read that value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 106.86,
          "end": 108.84,
          "en": "because it no longer is a Signal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.84,
          "end": 111.15299999999999,
          "en": "Instead, we just use it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 113.1,
          "end": 116.88,
          "en": "If you do that and you save everything and you reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 116.88,
          "end": 119.19,
          "en": "and you again wait for those timers to expire",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 119.19,
          "end": 124.05,
          "en": "so that the log here isn't messed up, I can enter values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 124.05,
          "end": 125.94,
          "en": "and that works as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 125.94,
          "end": 129.3,
          "en": "But if I save this, you'll see something interesting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 129.3,
          "end": 131.403,
          "en": "The message is not showing up down here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 132.39,
          "end": 135.48,
          "en": "And indeed here, if you take a look at the log messages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 135.48,
          "end": 137.38,
          "en": "you won't see a log message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 138.504,
          "end": 139.86,
          "en": "for this messages list component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 139.86,
          "end": 142.307,
          "en": "It's not part of that log",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 142.307,
          "end": 144.42000000000002,
          "en": "because change detection wasn't triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 144.42000000000002,
          "end": 145.98,
          "en": "for that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 145.98,
          "end": 149.55,
          "en": "And why was that the case?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 149.55,
          "end": 152.622,
          "en": "Well, because the messages list component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 152.622,
          "end": 155.34,
          "en": "is on push component, and therefore as I explained,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.34,
          "end": 158.22,
          "en": "change detection for this component runs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 158.22,
          "end": 159.84,
          "en": "if an input changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.84,
          "end": 162.21,
          "en": "And here I have no inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.21,
          "end": 166.38,
          "en": "If we trigger it manually, and that's not happening here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 166.38,
          "end": 169.688,
          "en": "If we have an event in this component or a child component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 169.688,
          "end": 173.37,
          "en": "And that's also not the case here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 173.37,
          "end": 176.28,
          "en": "Or if a Signal changes here in this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.28,
          "end": 178.563,
          "en": "And that's also not the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 179.507,
          "end": 182.1,
          "en": "and that's why this component is never checked for changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 182.1,
          "end": 184.68,
          "en": "and why the new message doesn't show up here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 184.68,
          "end": 187.62,
          "en": "So what can you do in situations like this?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 187.62,
          "end": 189.57,
          "en": "That's exactly what we'll take a look at",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 189.57,
          "end": 190.713,
          "en": "in the next lectures.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
